# Both Dockerfiles are `COPY . .` into a rust image, so everything not listed
# here is uploaded before the build starts. Cargo build output alone is ~2.6 GB
# across the workspace and per-crate target dirs, and none of it reaches the
# image: without this file a local `docker build` ships gigabytes to the daemon
# instead of ~5 MB.
#
# `**/target` and not `target/`: a .dockerignore pattern is rooted at the
# context, so the bare form misses server/target and rendezvous/target.
**/target
/client/build/

# A secret must never become an image layer; compose reads .env from the deploy
# directory at run time, not from the build context.
.env
.env.local

# No crate is excluded even when only one is built: cargo resolves every
# workspace member's Cargo.toml for `-p dioxusfun-server`.

.git/
node_modules/
discordia-data/
rendezvous-data/
client/nsis/MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
*.log
